---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: caller authorized
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: block.timestamp <= refundEndTime
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_timing --> q_check_published: refund period ended
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: results already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set_merkle: results not yet published
    q_set_merkle --> q_set_totals: set claimMerkleRoot, acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_set_totals --> q_set_flags: set totalTokensAllocated, totalCapitalRaised, totalCapitalAccepted
    q_set_flags --> [*]: resultsPublished = true, emit SaleResultsPublished

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-001: results can only be published after refund period ends
        INV-002: only Legion operators can publish results
    end note

    note right of q_set_merkle
        INV-003: Merkle roots are immutable once set
        INV-004: totalCapitalRaised <= totalCapitalInvested
    end note
